    <metaDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[Optimizely is one of the core Digital Experience Platforms (DXPs) that we work with here at 3Chillies. It’s a mature, feature-rich and flexible platform and offers a range of capabilities, with a number of recognised strengths in areas such as optimisation and A/B testing.]]></Value>
