imation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/ten-ways-to-fall-back-in-love-with-your-cms/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/3zpfignx/keyboard-70506_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0776523ce490\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/3zpfignx/keyboard-70506_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0776523ce490\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Close up image of a computer keyboard \u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/3zpfignx/keyboard-70506_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0776523ce490\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/3zpfignx/keyboard-70506_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0776523ce490\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/3zpfignx/keyboard-70506_1280.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc0776523ce490\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003ETen ways to fall back in love with your CMS\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIf you are your team are feeling disengaged from your CMS and you\u2019re starting to actively think about replacing it, it\u2019s always worth considering whether there are ways to view and use your current CMS differently.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E24 Sep 2024\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/content-management/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Content Management\u0022\u003EContent Management\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/development/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Development\u0022\u003EDevelopment\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/upgrades/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Upgrades\u0022\u003EUpgrades\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/sitecore/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Sitecore\u0022\u003ESitecore\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/umbraco/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Umbraco\u0022\u003EUmbraco\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/optimizely/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Optimizely\u0022\u003EOptimizely\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item-blog items-3 item_text-below text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/what-to-expect-when-upgrading-your-content-management-system/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/0f2p3c54/federico-beccari-ahi73zn5p0y-unsplash.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc076db438e710\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/0f2p3c54/federico-beccari-ahi73zn5p0y-unsplash.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc076db438e710\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Abstract image taken with a long exposure of light lines over sunset\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/0f2p3c54/federico-beccari-ahi73zn5p0y-unsplash.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc076db438e710\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/0f2p3c54/federico-beccari-ahi73zn5p0y-unsplash.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc076db438e710\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/0f2p3c54/federico-beccari-ahi73zn5p0y-unsplash.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc076db438e710\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EWhat to expect when upgrading your CMS\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIn this post we\u2019re going to explore the normal process that we follow when we carry out a CMS upgrade involving a platform like Sitecore, Umbraco or Optimizely.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E30 Apr 2024\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/umbraco/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Umbraco\u0022\u003EUmbraco\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/sitecore/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Sitecore\u0022\u003ESitecore\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/optimizely/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Optimizely\u0022\u003EOptimizely\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/upgrades/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Upgrades\u0022\u003EUpgrades\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item-blog items-3 item_text-below text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/how-optimizely-is-evolving-to-support-headless-publishing-and-the-composable-dxp/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/fv2o4f14/alexander-grey-62vi3tg5edg-unsplash.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc077b0315bb80\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/fv2o4f14/alexander-grey-62vi3tg5edg-unsplash.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc077b0315bb80\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Abstract close up image of some white fairy lights\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/fv2o4f14/alexander-grey-62vi3tg5edg-unsplash.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc077b0315bb80\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/fv2o4f14/alexander-grey-62vi3tg5edg-unsplash.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc077b0315bb80\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/fv2o4f14/alexander-grey-62vi3tg5edg-unsplash.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc077b0315bb80\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EHow Optimizely is evolving to support headless publishing and the composable DXP\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe latest platform to evolve their platform to better support composability and headless publishing is Optimizely, a feature-rich DXP that we\u2019ve been proud to work with for a number of years.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E10 Nov 2023\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/optimizely/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Optimizely\u0022\u003EOptimizely\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item-blog items-3 item_text-below text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/five-digital-customer-experience-and-digital-experience-platform-dxp-trends-for-2023/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/schlm50a/dandelion-2432381_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0779fcdab0a0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/schlm50a/dandelion-2432381_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0779fcdab0a0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Close up image of dandelion seeds with moisture clinging to them\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/schlm50a/dandelion-2432381_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0779fcdab0a0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/schlm50a/dandelion-2432381_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0779fcdab0a0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/schlm50a/dandelion-2432381_1280.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc0779fcdab0a0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EFive digital customer experience and Digital Experience Platform (DXP) trends for 2023\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHere\u2019s our view of five digital customer experience and DXP trends we think we\u2019ll see in 2023.\u00A0\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E08 Dec 2022\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/optimizely/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Optimizely\u0022\u003EOptimizely\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/sitecore/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Sitecore\u0022\u003ESitecore\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/umbraco/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Umbraco\u0022\u003EUmbraco\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item-blog items-3 item_text-below text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/getting-started-with-personalisation/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eu